      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Top Hoodie Manufacturers Worldwide</h2>
      <p style="color: #374151; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; max-width: 700px;">These manufacturers have been selected based on our evaluation criteria, direct production experience, and compliance records.</p>

      <!-- SDF -->
      <div style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <div>
