            <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">Dhaka, Bangladesh · Est. 1998 · Exports to USA, UK, EU, Australia</p>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 0.25rem;">Starting MOQ</p>
            <p style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin: 0;">100 pcs</p>
