        <p style="color: #374151; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          SDF Clothing has manufactured hoodies for global brands since 1998. Their knitwear division produces pullover hoodies, zip-up hoodies, half-zip styles, oversized fits, and cropped hoodies across a full range of GSM weights from 280 to 550 GSM. In-house fleece knitting capability means GSM tolerance is controlled from yarn to finished garment, which is critical for heavyweight streetwear where a 20 GSM variance can ruin the premium feel of a product.
