          <div><p style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #6b7280; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 0.35rem;">Best For</p><p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #111827; margin: 0;">All brand sizes, streetwear, private label</p></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 1.25rem; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem;">
