  <section id="case-study" style="padding: 4rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; background: #f9fafb;">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Real Brand Case Study</h2>
      <div style="border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 10px; padding: 2.5rem; background: #fff;">
        <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 1rem;">Case Study</p>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 1rem;">How a US Streetwear Brand Got 300 Heavyweight Hoodies at $14.50 Per Unit Landed</h3>
        <p style="color: #374151; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1rem;">A New York streetwear brand approached us needing 300 heavyweight pullover hoodies at 420 GSM with screen-printed graphics and woven labels for their seasonal drop. Their budget was $5,000 including shipping to New York.</p>
        <p style="color: #374151; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1rem;">The tech pack specified 420 GSM 100% ring-spun cotton, oversized fit, kangaroo pocket with internal fleece, custom aglets, and woven label. We sent a pre-production sample within 12 days. After one round of fit adjustments to the hood drop, the sample was approved.</p>
        <p style="color: #374151; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Bulk production completed in 32 days. AQL 2.5 inline and final inspections confirmed zero defects on GSM, seam strength, color fastness, and shrinkage. Sea freight to New York took 28 days.</p>
        <p style="color: #374151; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Total landed cost per unit: $14.50 including manufacturing, labels, screen print, poly bags, freight, and US import duty. The brand retailed the hoodies at $95 each. The entire run sold out in 6 days.</p>
        <div style="padding: 1rem 1.25rem; background: #f0fdf4; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 3px solid #10b981;">
          <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #065f46; margin: 0;"><strong>Key Lesson:</strong> Specifying GSM in writing, requesting a shrinkage test before production, and using a factory with in-house fleece knitting saved this brand from the two most common hoodie failures — wrong weight and post-wash size change.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

